  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jalalpur Irrigation Project Design Advance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Jalalpur Irrigation Project is located in Punjab, Pakistan. The project will provide irrigation from summer floods to 65,000 hectares and will increase agricultural production of rainfed areas in Jhelum and Khushab districts. The project will (i) construct over 200 kilometers of new irrigation canals, (ii) introduce a farmers-based irrigation management, and (iii) train farmers in good farming practices. It will directly benefit over 200,000 rural people, mostly poor, through creation of new jobs and improving livelihood, food security, and economic growth.</narrative>
  </description>
